cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Meshwell in research, cite the Zenodo DOI for the release you used.
  Use the concept DOI when citing the project as a whole.
title: meshwell
abstract: >-
  Meshwell is a Python library for generating 2.5D meshes from planar geometries
  and their extrusions. It uses Open CASCADE for CAD and Gmsh for mesh
  generation, with support for prismatic and tetrahedral meshes and remeshing.
